0..71 Comment "//! `abandoned` gives a cancellation that abandons a task continuation."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..151 Comment "//! The exit clause abandons the rest of its scope. The exit clause cancels"
152..169 Comment "//! the task end."
170..173 Comment "//!"
174..250 Comment "//! The handler starts a task. The task sends its note. The task closes. The"
251..313 Comment "//! exit operation abandons the continuation before a receive."
